# PyCastle agent scratch files (transient): a phase's plan, a retried attempt's
# handoff, and any issue scratch land in .pycastle/ during a self-hosting run.
# Excluded so `git add -A` never folds them into an issue branch or the run's PR.
.pycastle/handoff.md
.pycastle/plan.md
.pycastle/issue.md
